[{"id":"MTg2-q01","number":1,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Hasil penjumlahan semua bilangan bulat di antara. <img alt=\"\\sqrt[3]{2006}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csqrt%5B3%5D%7B2006%7D\" /> dan <img alt=\"\\sqrt{2006}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csqrt%7B2006%7D\" /> adalah....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4MQ"},{"id":"MTg2-q02","number":2,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pada trapesium ABCD, sisi AB sejajar dengan DC. Sebuah lingkaran yang menyinggung keempat sisi trapesium dapat dibuat. Jika AB = 75 dan DC&nbsp;= 40, maka keliling trapesium ABCD = ....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4Mg"},{"id":"MTg2-q03","number":3,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Himpunan semua <img alt=\"x\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x\" />&nbsp;yang memenuhi <img alt=\"(x-1)^{3}+(x-2)^{2}=1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28x-1%29%5E%7B3%7D&amp;plus;%28x-2%29%5E%7B2%7D%3D1\" /> adalah . . .</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4Mw"},{"id":"MTg2-q04","number":4,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Bilangan prima dua-angka terbesar yang merupakan jumlah dua bilangan prima lainnya adalah . ..</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4NA"},{"id":"MTg2-q05","number":5,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Afkar memilih suku-suku barisan geometri takhingga 1, <img alt=\"\\frac{1}{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D\" />, <img alt=\"\\frac{1}{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D\" />&nbsp;, <img alt=\"\\frac{1}{8}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B8%7D\" />, . . . untuk membuat barisan geometri takhingga baru yang jumlahnya <img alt=\"\\frac{1}{7}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B7%7D\" />. Tiga suku pertama pilihan Afkar adalah . ..</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4NQ"},{"id":"MTg2-q06","number":6,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Luas sisi-sisi sebuah balok adalah 486,486,243,243,162, 162. Volume balok tersebut adalah .. .</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4Ng"},{"id":"MTg2-q07","number":7,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Nilai maksimum fungsi f (x) = <img alt=\"(\\frac{1}{3})^{x^{2}-4x+3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B3%7D%29%5E%7Bx%5E%7B2%7D-4x&amp;plus;3%7D\" /> adalah ....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4Nw"},{"id":"MTg2-q08","number":8,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diberikan fungsi f(x) = ||x - 2| - a|&nbsp;- 3. Jika grafik f memotong sumbu-x tepat di tiga titik, maka a = . . .</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4OA"},{"id":"MTg2-q09","number":9,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk bilangan asli n, tuliskan s(n) = 1 + 2 + .... + n dan p(n) = 1 x&nbsp;2 x - - - x n. Bilangan genap n terkecil yang memenuhi p(n) habis dibagi s(n) adalah ....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg4OQ"},{"id":"MTg2-q10","number":10,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika |x|+ x + y = 10 dan z+ |y| - y = 12,maka x + y = ...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5MA"},{"id":"MTg2-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah himpunan tiga bilangan asli disebut <em>himpunan aritmatika</em> jika salah satu unsurnya merupakan rata-rata dari dua unsur lainnya. Banyaknya subhimpunan aritmatika dari {1, 2, 3, . . . ,8} adalah ...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5MQ"},{"id":"MTg2-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Dari setiap bilangan satu-angka a, bilangan N dibuat dengan menyandingkan ketiga bilangan a + 2, a + 1, a , yaitu N = (a + 2)(a + l)a. Sebagai contoh, untuk a = 8, N = 1098. Kesepuluh bilangan N semacam itu memiliki faktor persekutuan terbesar . . .</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5Mg"},{"id":"MTg2-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika&nbsp;<img alt=\"x^{^{2}}+\\frac{1}{x^{2}}=47\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E%7B%5E%7B2%7D%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bx%5E%7B2%7D%7D%3D47\" />&nbsp;, maka&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\sqrt{x}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}=\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csqrt%7Bx%7D&amp;plus;%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5Csqrt%7Bx%7D%7D%3D\" /> ....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5Mw"},{"id":"MTg2-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah kelas akan memilih seorang murid di antara mereka untuk mewakili kelas tersebut. Setiap murid mempunyai kesempatan yang sama untuk dipilih. Peluang seorang murid laki-laki terpilih sama dengan&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\frac{2}{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cfrac%7B2%7D%7B3%7D\" />&nbsp; kali peluang terpilihnya seorang murid perempuan. Persentase murid laki-laki di kelas tersebut adalah . . .</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5NA"},{"id":"MTg2-q15","number":15,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pada segitiga ABC, garis bagi sudut A memotong sisi BC di titik D. Jika AB = AD = 2 dan BD = 1,maka CD = ...&nbsp;</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5NQ"},{"id":"MTg2-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika <img alt=\"(x-1)^{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28x-1%29%5E%7B2%7D\" /> membagi <img alt=\"ax^{4} + bx^{3}+1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?ax%5E%7B4%7D%20&amp;plus;%20bx%5E%7B3%7D&amp;plus;1\" />&nbsp;,maka ab = ...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5Ng"},{"id":"MTg2-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Dari titik O ditarik dua setengah-garis (sinar) <img alt=\"l_{1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?l_%7B1%7D\" /> dan <img alt=\"l_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?l_%7B2%7D\" /> yang membentuk sudut lancip <img alt=\"\\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Calpha\" />. Titik-titik berbeda <img alt=\"A_{1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B1%7D\" />,<img alt=\"A_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B3%7D\" />, <img alt=\"A_{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B5%7D\" /> terletak pada garis <img alt=\"l_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?l_%7B2%7D\" />, sedangkan titik-titik <img alt=\"A_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B2%7D\" />,<img alt=\"A_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B4%7D\" />,<img alt=\"A_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B6%7D\" /> terletak di <img alt=\"l_{1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?l_%7B1%7D\" />. Jika <img alt=\"A_{1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B1%7D\" /><img alt=\"A_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B2%7D\" /> = <img alt=\"A_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B2%7D\" /><img alt=\"A_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B3%7D\" /> =<img alt=\"A_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B3%7D\" /><img alt=\"A_{4}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B4%7D\" />&nbsp;=&nbsp;<img alt=\"A_{4}O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B4%7DO\" />&nbsp;=&nbsp;<img alt=\"OA_{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?OA_%7B5%7D\" />&nbsp;=&nbsp;<img alt=\"A_{5}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B5%7D\" /><img alt=\"A_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B6%7D\" />&nbsp;=&nbsp;<img alt=\"A_{6}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B6%7D\" /><img alt=\"A_{1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?A_%7B1%7D\" />, maka&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Calpha\" /> = ....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5Nw"},{"id":"MTg2-q18","number":18,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Banyaknya bilangan 7-angka berbeda yang dapat dibentuk dengan cara mengubah susunan angka dari 2504224 adalah . . .</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5OA"},{"id":"MTg2-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Evan membuat sebuah barisan bilangan asli <img alt=\"a_{1}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?a_%7B1%7D\" />,&nbsp;<img alt=\"a_{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?a_%7B2%7D\" />, <img alt=\"a_{3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?a_%7B3%7D\" />, . . . yang meme- nuhi <img alt=\"a_{k+1}-a_{k}=2(a_{k-}a_{k-1})\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?a_%7Bk&amp;plus;1%7D-a_%7Bk%7D%3D2%28a_%7Bk-%7Da_%7Bk-1%7D%29\" />, untuk <img alt=\"k\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?k\" /> = 2,3,.. . , dan <img alt=\"a_{2}-a_{1}=2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?a_%7B2%7D-a_%7B1%7D%3D2\" />. Jika 2006 muncul dalam barisan, nilai al terkecil yang mungkin adalah ...</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/Nzg5OQ"},{"id":"MTg2-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Pada segitiga ABC, garis-garis berat dari titik sudut B dan titik sudut C saling berpotongan tegak lurus. Nilai minimum ctg B+ctg C&nbsp;adalah ....</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NzkwMA"},{"id":"MTg2-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan segitiga ABC siku-siku di B. Garis tinggi dari B memotong sisi AC di titik D. Jika titik E dan F berturut-turut adalah titik tengah BD dan CD, buktikan bahwa AE <img alt=\"\\perp\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Cperp\" /> BF.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NzkwMQ"},{"id":"MTg2-q22","number":22,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan m bilangan asli yang memenuhi 1003 &lt; m &lt; 2006. Diberikan himpunan bilangan asli S = {1, 2, 3, . . . ,m}, berapa banyak anggota S harus dipilih agar selalu terdapat paling sedikit satu pasang anggota terpilih yang hasil tambahnya 2006?</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NzkwMg"},{"id":"MTg2-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan <img alt=\"d\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?d\" /> = <img alt=\"\\text{FPB}(7n+5,5n+4)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Ctext%7BFPB%7D%287n&amp;plus;5%2C5n&amp;plus;4%29\" />, dimana <img alt=\"n\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?n\" /> adalah bilangan asli.<br /><br /> (a) Buktikan bahwa untuk setiap bilangan asli n berlaku d = 1 atau d = 3.<br /> (b) Buktikan bahwa d = 3 jika dan hanya jika 11. = 3k + 1, untuk suatu bilangan asli k.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NzkwMw"},{"id":"MTg2-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Win memiliki dua koin. Ia akan melakukan prosedur berikut berulang-ulang selama ia masih memiliki koin: lempar semua koin yang dimilikinya secara bersamaan; setiap koin yang muncul dengan sisi angka akan diberikannya kepada Albert. Ten- tukan peluang bahwa Win alan mengulangi prosedur ini lebih dari tiga kali.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NzkwNA"},{"id":"MTg2-q25","number":25,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Misalkan a, b, c bilangan-bilangan asli. Jika. semua akan ketiga persamaan<br /><br /><img alt=\"x^{2}-2ax+b=0\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E%7B2%7D-2ax&amp;plus;b%3D0\" /><br /><img alt=\"x^{2}-2bx+c=0\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E%7B2%7D-2bx&amp;plus;c%3D0\" /><br /><img alt=\"x^{2}-2cx+a=0\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?x%5E%7B2%7D-2cx&amp;plus;a%3D0\" /><br /><br /> adalah bilangan asli, tentukan a, b dan c.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NzkwNQ"}]
